    <!-- About / help / privacy -->
    <string name="about_body">CampusConnect %1$s\n\nA university campus platform for discovering events, joining study groups, exchanging skills and tracking attendance.\n\nBuilt as an academic project.</string>
    <string name="help_body">Getting started:\n\n\u2022 Students \u2014 search naturally, e.g. \"I like football\" or \"AI events this weekend\". RSVP to an event to get your QR ticket.\n\n\u2022 Organizers \u2014 use Create Event with AI, then scan attendee QR codes at the door to record attendance.\n\n\u2022 Admins \u2014 review reports under Moderation and check platform statistics on the dashboard.\n\nIf AI features are unavailable, regular search and manual event creation continue to work.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Your data stays on this device.\n\n\u2022 Account details, events, RSVPs and messages are stored in a local database on your phone.\n\u2022 Passwords are stored as salted hashes, never as plain text.\n\u2022 If AI features are enabled, only the text of your question and the relevant campus statistics are sent to Google Gemini to phrase a reply. Your password is never sent.\n\u2022 Clearing app data removes everything permanently.</string>
